                    margin-left: auto;">
                    
Dear {!Contact.FirstName},  <br /><br />

We did receive your photo submission and it was approved, an email was sent to your ASU email address but it may have gone to your junk mail.  At this point you need to submit a request for your card. <br/><br/>

If you would like to pick up your card at one of our on-campus locations, please submit a <a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/webform/basic-sun-card-office-pick-form">
<u>Pickup Form</u></a>. <br/><br/>

If you would like to have your card mailed to you, please submit a <a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/campus-id-card-request-form">
<u>Mail Request Form</u></a>. <br/><br/>

After we have processed your request, we will send you a confirmation email.  If applicable, a fee of $25.00 will be applied to your student account within the next few business days.<br/><br/>

Regards, <br />
 {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
